{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "范围与边界",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 152.31,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "账户变成合约，登录和授权的方式也变了。",
   "spoken": "账户变成合约，登录和授权的方式也变了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "Passkey 用设备的安全芯片保存私钥，用指纹或面容解锁。",
   "spoken": "Passkey 用设备的安全芯片保存私钥，用指纹或面容解锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.996,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 6.094,
   "speechEnd": 10.427
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "它能挡住钓鱼网站偷密码，挡不住恶意前端和恶意浏览器扩展。",
   "spoken": "它能挡住钓鱼网站偷密码，挡不住恶意前端和恶意浏览器扩展。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.496,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 11.594,
   "speechEnd": 16.546
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "你解锁以后，它们照样能请你签攻击者构造的操作。",
   "spoken": "你解锁以后，它们照样能请你签攻击者构造的操作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.62,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 17.718,
   "speechEnd": 21.444
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "社交恢复，由几位守护人一起恢复账户。",
   "spoken": "社交恢复，由几位守护人一起恢复账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.496,
   "dur": 4.296,
   "speechStart": 22.594,
   "speechEnd": 25.963
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "守护人不独立，或者账号被盗，恢复就成了入口。",
   "spoken": "守护人不独立，或者账号被盗，恢复就成了入口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.012,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 27.11,
   "speechEnd": 30.788
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "Session Key 是会话密钥，主密钥授权的一把临时密钥。",
   "spoken": "Session Key 是会话密钥，主密钥授权的一把临时密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.84,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 31.938,
   "speechEnd": 35.795
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "它的范围要限定四件事：哪个合约、哪个函数、累计额度、有效期。",
   "spoken": "它的范围要限定四件事：哪个合约、哪个函数、垒计额度、有效期。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.86,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 36.958,
   "speechEnd": 42.743
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月，链游 Cardex 让所有用户，共用同一把会话密钥。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月，链游 Cardex 让所有用户，共用同一把会话密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.8,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 43.898,
   "speechEnd": 48.874
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "这把密钥的私钥，就写在前端代码里。",
   "spoken": "这把密钥的私钥，就写在前端代码里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 49.924,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 50.022,
   "speechEnd": 52.712
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "约 9000 个钱包受影响，损失约 40 万美元。",
   "spoken": "约 9000 个钱包受影响，损失约 40 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 53.768,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 53.866,
   "speechEnd": 57.485
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "权限只限于游戏合约，用户的代币和 NFT 没有受影响。",
   "spoken": "权限只限于游戏合约，用户的代币和 NFT 没有受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 58.548,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 58.646,
   "speechEnd": 63.217
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "范围限制起了作用。",
   "spoken": "范围限制起了作用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 64.264,
   "dur": 2.208,
   "speechStart": 64.362,
   "speechEnd": 65.635
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "意图，是用户只说目标，由 Solver 去找成交路径。",
   "spoken": "意图，是用户只说目标，由 Solver 去找成交路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 66.692,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 66.79,
   "speechEnd": 70.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "比如，用 1 ETH 换至少 3000 USDC。",
   "spoken": "比如，用 1 ETH 换至少 3000 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.76,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 71.858,
   "speechEnd": 75.298
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "用户的风险，是条件写得太宽，最低成交量太低，期限拖得太久。",
   "spoken": "用户的风险，是条件写得太宽，最低成交亮太低，期限拖得太久。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 76.372,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 76.47,
   "speechEnd": 81.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "协议的风险，在 Solver 和结算合约之间的信任。",
   "spoken": "协议的风险，在 Solver 和结算合约之间的信任。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 82.688,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 82.786,
   "speechEnd": 85.976
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "2023 年 2 月，CoW Swap 新加入了一个 Solver。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 2 月，CoW Swap 新加入了一个 Solver。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 87.036,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 87.134,
   "speechEnd": 90.991
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "它把结算合约里的 DAI，无限授权给一个有漏洞的合约。",
   "spoken": "它把结算合约里的 DAI，无限授权给一个有漏洞的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 92.056,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 92.154,
   "speechEnd": 96.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "结算合约里约一周的手续费被取走，约 16.6 万美元。",
   "spoken": "结算合约里约一周的手续费被取走，约 16.6 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 97.1,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 97.198,
   "speechEnd": 101.126
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "CoW DAO 罚没了这个 Solver 的保证金来赔偿。",
   "spoken": "CoW DAO 罚莫了这个 Solver 的保证金来赔偿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 102.192,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 102.29,
   "speechEnd": 105.409
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "2025 年 3 月，一些第三方 Resolver，仍在用 1inch 已经弃用的 Fusion v1 结算合约。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 3 月，一些第三方 Resolver，仍在用 1inch 已经弃用的 Fusion v1 结算合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-21.mp3",
   "start": 106.468,
   "dur": 7.416,
   "speechStart": 106.566,
   "speechEnd": 113.054
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-22",
   "text": "它们只凭调用者是结算合约，就信任转发来的数据。",
   "spoken": "它们只凭掉用者是结算合约，就信任转发来的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-22.mp3",
   "start": 114.104,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 114.202,
   "speechEnd": 118.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-23",
   "text": "攻击者借此伪造订单，约 500 万美元，大部分经谈判退回。",
   "spoken": "攻击者借此伪造订单，约 500 万美元，大部分经谈判退回。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-23.mp3",
   "start": 119.076,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 119.174,
   "speechEnd": 123.828
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-24",
   "text": "Permit2 是 Uniswap 部署的统一授权合约。",
   "spoken": "Permit2 是 Uniswap 部署的统一授权合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-24.mp3",
   "start": 124.888,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 124.986,
   "speechEnd": 128.414
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-25",
   "text": "只要你把某个代币无限授权给它，之后一个链下签名，就能转走这个代币。",
   "spoken": "只要你把某个代币无限授权给它，之后一个链下签名，就能转走这个代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-25.mp3",
   "start": 129.476,
   "dur": 6.648,
   "speechStart": 129.574,
   "speechEnd": 135.288
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-26",
   "text": "2024 年 10 月，一名 PEPE 持有者签了 Permit2 钓鱼签名，损失约 140 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 10 月，一名 PEPE 持有者签了 Permit2 钓鱼签名，损失约 140 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-26.mp3",
   "start": 136.344,
   "dur": 7.656,
   "speechStart": 136.442,
   "speechEnd": 143.168
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-27",
   "text": "没有发现 Permit2 合约本身被攻破，风险来自无限授权加上链下签名。",
   "spoken": "没有发现 Permit2 合约本身被攻破，风险来自无限授权加上链下签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg5-27.mp3",
   "start": 144.22,
   "dur": 6.888,
